      "id": "e96050d8-feff-4032-ad13-95535856c247",
      "name": "Export Jobs",
      "description": {
        "content": "Export Jobs allow you to export subscription data asynchronously. You first create an export job, then retrieve the results when the job is complete.",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
